# Suppress warnings about missing parent POMs for old Apache Geronimo spec artifacts
# (geronimo-jms_1.1_spec, geronimo-jta_1.1_spec, geronimo-j2ee-management_1.1_spec)
# pulled transitively via ActiveMQ 5.16.8. Their parent POMs (genesis.config:config:1.1,
# specs:1.3) were never published to Maven Central. The artifacts themselves resolve fine.
-Dorg.slf4j.simpleLogger.log.org.apache.maven.model.building.DefaultModelBuilder=error
